user_template:
Task: {user_task}

REQUIRED JSON SCHEMA (strict):
{
  "task_summary": "string (short summary)",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": integer,
      "title": "string",
      "description": "string (what to do)",
      "tool": "string (tool name from supported_tools)",
      "inputs": { "any": "value" },
      "expected_output_schema": { "type": "object", "required": ["..."] },
      "retry": integer (0-5)
    }
  ],
  "supported_tools": [
    { "name": "GitHubTool", "purpose": "Search repos, fetch repo details" },
    { "name": "WeatherTool", "purpose": "Fetch weather by city" },
    { "name": "NewsTool", "purpose": "Fetch news (optional)" }
  ],
  "final_output_schema": { "type":"object", "required": ["summary","evidence","confidence"] },
  "estimated_time_minutes": integer
}

INSTRUCTIONS:
- Break the task into a minimal ordered set of steps.
- Each step must select one of the supported_tools.
- Provide `expected_output_schema` for every step (a JSON Schema fragment).
- Set reasonable `retry` counts.
- Keep `task_summary` short (<120 chars).

Example Planner JSON (for reference only — Planner must return JSON):
{
  "task_summary":"Find top 3 Python web frameworks on GitHub and Bangalore weather",
  "steps":[
    {"id":1,"title":"Search frameworks","description":"Search GitHub for popular Python web frameworks","tool":"GitHubTool","inputs":{"query":"python web framework","per_page":10}, "expected_output_schema":{"type":"object","required":["repos"]},"retry":2},
    {"id":2,"title":"Get repo details","description":"Fetch details for top 3 repos","tool":"GitHubTool","inputs":{"repo_list":["..."]},"expected_output_schema":{"type":"object","required":["repos"]},"retry":2},
    {"id":3,"title":"Get weather","description":"Fetch current weather in Bangalore","tool":"WeatherTool","inputs":{"city":"Bangalore"},"expected_output_schema":{"type":"object","required":["temperature","conditions"]},"retry":1}
  ],
  "supported_tools":[
    {"name":"GitHubTool","purpose":"Search repos, fetch repo details"},
    {"name":"WeatherTool","purpose":"Fetch weather by city"},
    {"name":"NewsTool","purpose":"Fetch news (optional)"}
  ],
  "final_output_schema":{"type":"object","required":["summary","evidence","confidence"]},
  "estimated_time_minutes":3
}
